                            <comment id="17749563" author="vladsz83" created="Tue, 1 Aug 2023 08:35:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Caused by concurrent default checkpointer which clears shared &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
CheckpointProgress#clearCounters()
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;and rises hidden NPE in&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
@Override &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; void CheckpointProgressImpl#updateEvictedPages(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; delta) {
        A.ensure(delta &amp;gt; 0, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;param must be positive&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);

        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (evictedPagesCounter() != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;)
            evictedPagesCounter().addAndGet(delta);
    }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;while flushing replaced page in `PageMemoryImpl#allocatePage(int grpId, int partId, byte flags)`. See &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-20047&quot; title=&quot;NPE in evicted pages counter of the checkpoint progress.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-20047&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-20047&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &apos;failure_with_root_npe_cause.log&apos;.&lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
